section.about-section.py-5 style="background-color: #f5f1ed;"
  .container
    .row.align-items-start.g-5
      
      / Left: Image
      .col-12.col-lg-5
        div style="width: 100%; height: 400px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a2a2a 0%, #4a4a4a 100%); border-radius: 0.25rem;"

      / Right: Content
      .col-12.col-lg-7
        p.text-uppercase.fw-bold.small.mb-2 style="letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #8b8960;"
          | About
        h2.fw-bold.mb-3 style="color: #1a3a52; font-size: 2rem;"
          | Rooted in Faith. Growing Together.

        p.mb-3 style="color: #555; line-height: 1.6;"
          | [Church Name] Parish is a Christ-centered community dedicated to worship, sacrament, and spiritual growth.

        .d-flex.gap-4.mb-4.small style="color: #333;"
          span Street, Barangay, City
          span (+63) 946 166 6435

        / Accordion-style mission items
        .border-top style="border-color: #ddd !important;"
          - 3.times do
            .d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.py-3.border-bottom style="border-color: #ddd !important; cursor: pointer;"
              span.fw-medium style="color: #1a3a52;"
                | Our Mission
              span style="color: #999;"
                | ⌄

        a.btn.text-white.mt-4 href="#" style="background-color: #8b8960; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 0.2rem;"
          | About Our Church